  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Send an email",
   "texto": [
    "**Emne** means «Subject» and **vedlegg**, «attached file». In Norwegian, **legge ved et dokument** is said to indicate that a document is attached."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Short messages",
   "texto": [
    "**Beskjed** is a warning or errand. **Motta** means receiving; **mottaker**, recipient. **Snart** has already been learned in a previous chapter."
   ]
  },
